Comment: 1,0:02:32.04,0:02:34.47,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,梦想受到束缚
Comment: 1,0:02:35.00,0:02:37.18,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,沉重命运的磐石
Comment: 1,0:02:37.50,0:02:40.60,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,如同被压迫直至覆灭
Comment: 1,0:02:42.53,0:02:44.97,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,前方已无处逃避
Comment: 1,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.56,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,唯有挣扎着前行
Comment: 1,0:02:47.92,0:02:51.74,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是我永远不会放弃
Comment: 1,0:02:51.79,0:02:57.71,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,瓦砾之中埋藏的
Comment: 1,0:02:57.85,0:03:02.77,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,希望的碎片
Comment: 1,0:03:03.55,0:03:08.33,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,用这双手 将它们找寻
Comment: 1,0:03:08.42,0:03:13.84,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,只为改变这世间
Comment: 1,0:03:16.53,0:03:19.20,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,Fighting Gold
Comment: 1,0:03:19.26,0:03:28.97,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,唯有相信自己的道路之人 终有一天方能闪耀
Comment: 1,0:03:29.61,0:03:37.86,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,燃烧全部生命 即便是神亦无畏惧 战斗永不停息
Comment: 1,0:03:38.10,0:03:42.58,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,不屈的魂灵
Comment: 1,0:03:45.32,0:03:48.00,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,Fighting Gold
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 2,0:02:32.04,0:02:34.47,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,夢を縛りつける
Comment: 2,0:02:35.00,0:02:37.18,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,重たい運命の石に
Comment: 2,0:02:37.50,0:02:40.60,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,まるで押し潰されて
Comment: 2,0:02:42.53,0:02:44.97,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,どこにも逃げられない
Comment: 2,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.56,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,ひたすら足掻きながら
Comment: 2,0:02:47.92,0:02:51.74,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,だけどあきらめない
Comment: 2,0:02:51.79,0:02:57.71,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,瓦礫の底に埋もれた
Comment: 2,0:02:57.85,0:03:02.77,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,希望の破片たち
Comment: 2,0:03:03.55,0:03:08.33,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,きっとこの手で見つけだすさ
Comment: 2,0:03:08.42,0:03:13.84,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,世界を変えるために
Comment: 2,0:03:19.26,0:03:28.97,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,自分の道を信じた者だけがいつか輝ける
Comment: 2,0:03:29.61,0:03:37.86,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,命の限り 神にも逆らい 戦い続ける
Comment: 2,0:03:38.10,0:03:42.58,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,不屈の魂たちよ
